rse_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946476/assets/f11e50891625fb39de472762aaaff23edf43372e37fcdf55d129da1125c0ff8a.png)\n\nFind the area of $△ABC.$ Round your answer to two decimal places." :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}с & =AB=26, \\\\ b & =AC=22, \\\\ m∠A & ={11}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{11}^{∘}=0.190\\,809,\n$$\n\nrounded to six decimal places,  we calculate the area as follows:\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 22\\cdot 26\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{11}^{∘} \\\\  & =286\\cdot (0.190\\,809) \\\\  & ≈54.57,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-18027/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "acc86fb6-2ef4-5f8f-b204-6e1fdbbf0530"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-18027"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-279753/field-1/6cae8fadd202f9cac15edc687530ec0bc8e7a0d3d4a187fe7a083b0a08ace0d0" :answer/id #uuid "a18332e9-ae54-51b7-9174-c91fd57b832a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "93.5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-279753/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "17a8e155-9b4b-5c2f-a86b-8f003fc3d07b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-279753/field-1/6cae8fadd202f9cac15edc687530ec0bc8e7a0d3d4a187fe7a083b0a08ace0d0" :answer-field/choices ["q-279753/field-1/6cae8fadd202f9cac15edc687530ec0bc8e7a0d3d4a187fe7a083b0a08ace0d0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-279753" :question/id #uuid "bdf0daac-77bb-5aff-b5b4-b17585570165" :question/math-academy-id "q-279753" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946476/assets/68977537a5f180dd483534ed1415326251d4a76a3dd0833e9701487cd8b5b33d.png)\n\nRounded to the **nearest tenth**, the area of $△ABC$ is{{field-1}} ${\\text{ft}}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}с & =AB=18, \\\\ b & =AC=12, \\\\ m∠A & ={120}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{120}^{∘}=0.866\\,025,\n$$\n\nrounded to six decimal places,  we calculate the area as follows:\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 12\\cdot 18\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{120}^{∘} \\\\  & =108\\cdot (0.866\\,025…) \\\\  & ≈93.5\\,{\\text{ft}}^{2},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to the **nearest tenth**." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-279753/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "acc86fb6-2ef4-5f8f-b204-6e1fdbbf0530"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-279753"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-279752/field-1/32e5ba09d6c21d9ff4425dbdec465ccd42a14a97167a980b39fa1c9ab719828f" :answer/id #uuid "6e8b0230-c390-5fcf-ae5b-94286b8c3243" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10.3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-279752/field-1/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "95db3c31-3680-5524-ad5a-f20a09252d6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-279752/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "11f94e53-0b67-542e-ab28-05b559fefcb4" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-279752/field-1/32e5ba09d6c21d9ff4425dbdec465ccd42a14a97167a980b39fa1c9ab719828f" :answer-field/choices ["q-279752/field-1/32e5ba09d6c21d9ff4425dbdec465ccd42a14a97167a980b39fa1c9ab719828f" "q-279752/field-1/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-279752" :question/id #uuid "63f35d69-f7b6-5350-bda1-58836456b5aa" :question/math-academy-id "q-279752" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946476/assets/f41ad0635fb7bb426a387f825097a31dddb591861012f2543336a142832df9db.png)\n\nRounded to the **nearest tenth**, the area of $△ABC$ above is{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}ac\\operatorname{sin}⁡B,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠B$ is between the sides of lengths $a$ and $b.$ \n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=4, \\\\ a & =BC=8, \\\\ m∠B & ={40}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{40}^{∘}=0.642\\,788,\n$$\n\nrounded to six decimal places,  we calculate the area as follows:\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 8\\cdot 4\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{40}^{∘} \\\\  & =16\\cdot (0.642\\,788) \\\\  & ≈10.3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to the **nearest tenth**." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-279752/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "acc86fb6-2ef4-5f8f-b204-6e1fdbbf0530"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-279752"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-18021"] :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}с & =AB=3, \\\\ b & =AC=7, \\\\ m∠A & ={128}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{128}^{∘}=0.788\\,010,\n$$\n\nrounded to six decimal places,  we calculate the area as follows:\n \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 7\\cdot 3\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{128}^{∘} \\\\  & =10.5\\cdot (0.788\\,010) \\\\  & ≈8.27,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to two decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-365424/field-1/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" :answer/id #uuid "04dc0986-be5f-529d-ac62-9ae10a001994" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "45" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-365424/field-1/c89a78e01f135d27857f87b29786d3bde75753fd31e9ec00c0c39b58d64c0b12" :answer/id #uuid "00a4db1e-1a56-58e4-9940-4f16aae1bf16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "135" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-365424/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "1006680a-9706-5065-afd6-42b5aff1a29e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-365424/field-1/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" :answer-field/choices ["q-365424/field-1/ca566c3861ad95266b92d3d8e36c85c39daf1d1780cc1bf826ae0ac7accce583" "q-365424/field-1/c89a78e01f135d27857f87b29786d3bde75753fd31e9ec00c0c39b58d64c0b12"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-365424" :question/id #uuid "910bcc12-cda3-52d7-97f0-5d0df60f458d" :question/math-academy-id "q-365424" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946476/assets/7ead42d83a971733b601f45dcc1ad545a52298fc8a800ba69344651a54f4830d.png)\n\nThe area of the acute triangle $△ABC$ is $20\\sqrt{2}{\\text{ cm}}^{2}.$ Then, the measure of $∠A$ is{{field-1}} ${}^{∘}.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=8\\,\\text{cm}, \\\\ b & =AC=10\\,\\text{cm}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can calculate $m∠A$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ 20\\sqrt{2} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 10\\cdot 8\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ 20\\sqrt{2} & =40\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ \\frac{20\\sqrt{2}}{40} & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡A & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ m∠A & ={45}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-365424/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cafdb077-0e02-5e7a-bf78-c3a8aacfb6f7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-365424"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-161107/selection/dc53b23053b64400e357aa8287ba39f80c52b5c2c365e2714bbd62761c3632e1" :answer/id #uuid "5e5cad3b-9c6d-5123-bc8d-6a8a0fc29a2b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5.5\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-161107/selection/517c9144cd364dbc463702d890ec20f982520a14c1de8b2821860989f8e17d60" :answer/id #uuid "66327986-35d6-58fb-a241-38d01113ee5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.5\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-161107/selection/7185ea00cd8993e8610e79527b1004d89a356345fb3e0810e9a0873bd4dfbe8a" :answer/id #uuid "70bf0e37-e344-590f-8a78-4ab9085dd44c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-161107/selection/34d823738a2a8f5d53c5b6b285186d53246175590fff56018d16e22964007650" :answer/id #uuid "71051edb-3799-546b-bb07-b4109d22063d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-161107/selection/47fd1d001a0bb5afeddfce27a6bbad7e15d8ef11cfb9aedffd766796ab88a50b" :answer/id #uuid "84f0e954-89a2-5293-a2d2-7afdd09b3167" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-161107/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "d5461aee-52b1-557e-bf04-fc2749454404" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-161107/selection/34d823738a2a8f5d53c5b6b285186d53246175590fff56018d16e22964007650" :answer-field/choices ["q-161107/selection/dc53b23053b64400e357aa8287ba39f80c52b5c2c365e2714bbd62761c3632e1" "q-161107/selection/517c9144cd364dbc463702d890ec20f982520a14c1de8b2821860989f8e17d60" "q-161107/selection/7185ea00cd8993e8610e79527b1004d89a356345fb3e0810e9a0873bd4dfbe8a" "q-161107/selection/34d823738a2a8f5d53c5b6b285186d53246175590fff56018d16e22964007650" "q-161107/selection/47fd1d001a0bb5afeddfce27a6bbad7e15d8ef11cfb9aedffd766796ab88a50b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-161107" :question/id #uuid "f87bfa18-cb4b-532f-a120-eb1fc8ba9d73" :question/math-academy-id "q-161107" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13946476/assets/ef8379b21526455a723369fda4360e2d7d3ef3cf54ce7d7767df7bd160a169f4.png)\n\nThe area of ​​the triangle $△ABC$ is $5\\sqrt{3}\\,{\\text{cm}}^{2}.$ Find $AC.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the area of the triangle is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}bc\\operatorname{sin}⁡A,\n$$\n\nwhere $∠A$ is between the sides of lengths $b$ and $c.$ \n\nHere\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c & =AB=5\\text{ cm}, \\\\ b & =AC, \\\\ m∠A & ={60}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡{60}^{∘}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2},\n$$\n\nwe can calculate $b=AC,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot c\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡A \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 5\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡{60}^{∘} \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3} & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot b\\cdot 5\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\ 5\\sqrt{3} & =\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}\\,b}{4} \\\\ \\cancel{5\\sqrt{3}} & =\\frac{\\cancel{5\\sqrt{3}}\\,b}{4} \\\\ 1 & =\\frac{b}{4} \\\\ b & =4\\text{ cm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe conclude that $AC=4\\,\\text{cm}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-161107/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "cafdb077-0e02-5e7a-bf78-c3a8aacfb6f7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-161107"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-43339/selection/b8903bf0f0c79152fee06a2deb1a952caebfd91f17e1376aeed868a